--- !u!114 &231721931
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 231721930}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 960491f1fc711ee40a1446cde77d72d2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FightingGameTutorial
  player: {fileID: 644139990}
  dialogueUI: {fileID: 1511594232}
  opponentAI: {fileID: 1173407408}
  beginWhenRoundBecomesActive: 1
  openingDelay: 0.5
  openingMessageTime: 4
  successMessageTime: 4
  successResponseDelay: 2
  openingMessage: Okay, I know it's been a while. Let me remind you how to play.
  requiredMovementDistance: 0.5
  lessons:
  - step: 0
    instruction: First, move left and right with the control sitck or the 'A' and
      'D' keys.
    successResponse: Nice! You can review the controls by pressing the view button
      or tab key.
  - step: 1
    instruction: Now double-tap a direction to quickstep.
    successResponse: Quick! I like it.
  - step: 2
    instruction: Move up to jump and hold down to crouch. Try both.
    successResponse: Great! Different stances can avoid certain attacks.
  - step: 3
    instruction: Throw a punch with the west face button or the 'J' key. You can
      also punch while jumping or crouching.
    successResponse: Solid punch!
  - step: 4
    instruction: Now kick with the south face button or the 'K' key. Kicks also work
      while jumping or crouching.
    successResponse: Awesome kick!
  - step: 5
    instruction: Get close to me and perform a grab with the east face button or
      the 'L' key!
    successResponse: Nice grab! This is a smart move when your cornered and need
      some space.
  - step: 6
    instruction: Now walk backwards to block my attack!
    successResponse: Perfect defense! Blocking attacks will reduce your damage taken.
  - step: 7
    instruction: 'Go ahead and finish with your special move by punching and kicking
      at the same time. '
    successResponse: That was powerful! You only have three special moves per round,
      so use them carefully...
  finalMessage: Great work! Now lets get into the real thing. I wont be going easy!
  finalMessageTime: 2
  onTutorialCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
